              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "frēnō, frēnāre — \"to bridle; to hold back\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Puer equum frēnat, deinde ascendit. The boy bridles the horse, then gets on."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "frēnō, frēnāre, frēnāvī, frēnātum. Also figurative: īram frēnāre, to hold back anger."
            }
          ]
        },
