              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Raedārius scuticam habet, sed equōs nōn tangit. The coachman has a whip, but he does not touch the horses."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "First declension, feminine: scutica, scuticae f. A strap whip of leather."
            }
